brightnessctl, read and set screen backlight and keyboard led brightness through sysfs, no daemon. Examples: brightnessctl info, brightnessctl set 40%, brightnessctl set 5%-, brightnessctl -s set 10% (save the current level first).
A udev rule gives the video group write access to the backlight; add your user to the video group or run it as root.
